{"ref":"BDB, בִּיתָן","hw":"בִּיתָן","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">בִּיתָן</span></big>  <strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>] <strong>house, palace</strong>—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">הַבִּיתָן</span> <a data-ref=\"Esther 7:7\" href=\"/Esther.7.7\">Est 7:7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Esther 7:8\" href=\"/Esther.7.8\">8</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(גִּנַּת הב׳)</span> cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">בִּיתַן</span> <a data-ref=\"Esther 1:5\" href=\"/Esther.1.5\">Est 1:5</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(גִּנַּת ב׳ הַמֶּלֶךְ)</span>, all <em>garden of</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">בּ׳</span>; according to Dieulafoy<sup>RÉJ 1888, cclxxvii.</sup> <em>throne-room</em>, syn. of <em>apadâna</em> in meaning, but cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, אַפֶּ֫דֶן\" href=\"/BDB,_אַפֶּ֫דֶן\", dir=\"rtl\">אַפֶּדֶן</a>.","next":"BDB, בֵּית²","prev":"BDB, בֵּית־תַּפּוּחַ"}